SELECT e.name AS employee, m.name AS manager
FROM employees AS e
JOIN employees AS m ON m.id = e.manager_id;

content.referenceSolution:
SELECT e.name AS employee, m.name AS manager
FROM employees AS e
LEFT JOIN employees AS m ON m.id = e.manager_id;

content.description:
Сверьте остатки двух складов. Выведите **все** артикулы, которые есть хотя бы на одном складе:

- `sku`;
- `qty_a` — остаток на складе A (`NULL`, если артикула там нет);
- `qty_b` — остаток на складе B (`NULL`, если нет).

Имена столбцов проверяются.

```sql
CREATE TABLE warehouse_a(sku TEXT PRIMARY KEY, qty INTEGER NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE warehouse_b(sku TEXT PRIMARY KEY, qty INTEGER NOT NULL);
```

content.starterCode:
SELECT a.sku, a.qty AS qty_a, b.qty AS qty_b
FROM warehouse_a AS a
LEFT JOIN warehouse_b AS b ON b.sku = a.sku;

content.referenceSolution:
SELECT COALESCE(a.sku, b.sku) AS sku, a.qty AS qty_a, b.qty AS qty_b
FROM warehouse_a AS a
FULL JOIN warehouse_b AS b ON b.sku = a.sku;
